OL,3,GNEWSAInvictus Games volunteers sought
OL,4,Ato welcome veterans to city
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo thousand volunteers from across the
OL,7,Fworld are being sought to help with the
OL,8,FInvictus Games in Birmingham next July.
OL,10,FUp to 550 wounded, injured and unwell
OL,11,Fservice personnel and veterans from 25
OL,12,Fnations are due to take part in the
OL,13,Ftournament, which will run from 10 - 17
OL,14,FJuly.
OL,16,FA quarter of the roles are to be given
OL,17,Fto residents of Birmingham and the West
OL,18,FMidlands, with a further 25% reserved
OL,19,Ffor people from the armed forces
OL,20,Fcommunity.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
